  "id": "personalized-instruction",
  "term": "personalized instruction",
  "definition": "Personalized instruction is an approach to teaching that adjusts the learner’s pathway based on individual characteristics and ongoing learning states rather than giving everyone the same fixed sequence. In this study context, it used adaptive technology to tailor task difficulty, feedback, and instructional actions to support engagement, self-regulation, motivation, and performance.",
